      "writtenOn": "2015-06-27T01:07:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "this is going to need some more thought. this is called from PD task and blocks the PD task from continuing. Since, it could call i2c functions, this could block for a long time and cause PD errors.\n\nvincent ran into this recently on honeybuns, which also requires i2c in the mux setting function (CL:281927), and he decided to add a new task. that\u0027s quite a bit of overhead, so would like to think about it more.",
